{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"fish_salmon","model_identifier":"fish_salmon","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# fish_salmon\n\nSalmon (B8), 75 cm (26.7 u). Fringe streams.\n\nSilver sides with a darker blue-grey back, small black spots, and the hooked lower jaw (kype) of a spawning male. Rig: root > body (front segment) > body_mid > body_rear > tail_fin for the side-to-side swim wave; body > head > jaw; pectoral fins fin_r / fin_l.\n\n- Cubes: 16 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -3.2..3.2, y 0.0..7.8, z -13.8..13.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 3.7 x 6.4 x 26.8 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0 (belly)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `swim` | 0.8 | loop | body wave travelling to the tail (loop, played in place) |\n| `idle` | 2.4 | loop | gentle hover: slow wave, fins sculling, gills/jaw pulse (loop) |\n| `dart` | 0.32 | loop | fast flee, big tail beats, fins tucked (loop) |\n| `flop` | 1.2 | loop | caught, on land: lies on its right side and slaps up and down (loop) |\n| `death` | 2 | hold | rolls belly-up and holds; rests on y = 0 (the game can float it at the water surface) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `swim`: 28.4 u/s (0.8 m/s), wave cycle 0.8 s\n- `dart`: 142.2 u/s (4.0 m/s), wave cycle 0.32 s\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `fish_salmon_young.png`: young fish texture (use at half scale): paler, softer markings\n\n## Notes\n\n- Fish rest with the lowest fin on y = 0 so the same model lies correctly on land; in water the game sets the depth.\n"},"description":"# fish_salmon\n\nSalmon (B8), 75 cm (26.7 u). Fringe streams.\n\nSilver sides with a darker blue-grey back, small black spots, and the hooked lower jaw (kype) of a spawning male. Rig: root > body (front segment) > body_mid > body_rear > tail_fin for the side-to-side swim wave; body > head > jaw; pectoral fins fin_r / fin_l.\n\n- Cubes: 16 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -3.2..3.2, y 0.0..7.8, z -13.8..13.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 3.7 x 6.4 x 26.8 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0 (belly)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `swim` | 0.8 | loop | body wave travelling to the tail (loop, played in place) |\n| `idle` | 2.4 | loop | gentle hover: slow wave, fins sculling, gills/jaw pulse (loop) |\n| `dart` | 0.32 | loop | fast flee, big tail beats, fins tucked (loop) |\n| `flop` | 1.2 | loop | caught, on land: lies on its right side and slaps up and down (loop) |\n| `death` | 2 | hold | rolls belly-up and holds; rests on y = 0 (the game can float it at the water surface) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `swim`: 28.4 u/s (0.8 m/s), wave cycle 0.8 s\n- `dart`: 142.2 u/s (4.0 m/s), wave cycle 0.32 s\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `fish_salmon_young.png`: young fish texture (use at half scale): paler, softer markings\n\n## Notes\n\n- Fish rest with the lowest fin on y = 0 so the same model lies correctly on land; in water the game sets the depth.\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"head","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.75,0.75,-13.5],"to":[1.75,5.25,-8.25],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,3.0,-8.25],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[12,7,15.5,11.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[50,0,55.25,4.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[16,7,19.5,11.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[56,0,61.25,4.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[22,0,